# Calendar Agents Index

| Agent / skill | When |
|---|---|
| **calendar-component-workflow** | Adding/changing scheduler views or chrome |
| **calendar-code-quality** | Review — types/const separation, no magic values |
| **calendar-release-workflow** | Version bump, CHANGELOG, build, publish |

UI work follows ForgeStack Developer UI conventions. Publishing follows `@forgedevstack/*` CI pattern.

Version policy: patches `1.0.0`–`1.0.9`, then minor `1.1.0`.
